{"strings": {"Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement Deekula Mine Entrance/Hanss.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets11.assets"]}, "Letter to Hans": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets11.assets"]}, "Hanss,\n\n\nThat radio message you sent really helped me locate the place. I have reason to believe that he is likely inside, but the gates are closed. It appears that the entire place has been abandoned or, perhaps, sealed off intentionally. Unfortunately, the keypad appears to be without power, rendering me unable to enter the required code. Something is terribly wrong and I don't like it. That radio message doesn't make me feel any better.\n\n\nI think there must be some other way in, probably hidden in those old mine tunnels. The thing is, I don't have a clue where to start looking. I stumbled upon an old map from some guy who used to work at SNW, but it's not shedding any light on where that second entrance might be.\n\n\nThis situation is getting pretty complicated, and I share your unease about it. I'm going to keep searching and try to figure out what's going on here, so you can finally get the answers you've been looking for.\n\n\nBe careful.": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets11.assets"]}, "Water": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets11.assets"]}, "Light": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets11.assets"]}, "Ambience": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets11.assets"]}, "Wood": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets11.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Tasks/Glowstick trail/Look for hanss in the mines.asset": {"TaskObjective:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets11.assets"]}, "LookMines60": {"TaskObjective:id": ["sharedassets11.assets"]}, "Look for Hanss in the mines": {"TaskObjective:title": ["sharedassets11.assets"]}}}